{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/destinations\/delivery\/bufferdropreports"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations","doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Delivery"]]},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of the batches each destination’s full buffer drops, in the order they are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dropped."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"bufferDropReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","text":"AsyncQueue","identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12Destinations16BufferDropReportV","text":"BufferDropReport","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/BufferDropReport","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reports no one has read yet merge, one per destination: a destination’s later drops add"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"their record counts to its waiting report and widen its timestamps, so the reports waiting"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are at most one per destination, and a late reader still learns every count lost. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sequence ends once this delivery, every copy of it and every unit of work built on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Delivery\/work","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" are gone, their executions have returned, and every report has been read. Read"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the sequence into a constant before starting the task that reads it, so the task holds the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reports and not the delivery."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"One task reads the reports at a time. The first iterator to read holds them until its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"iteration ends or it is released; a second reader meanwhile waits its turn, logging a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"warning once, then reads on from the next report, so the first gets every report in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"order. A reader cancelled while it waits returns ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"property","roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"Destinations"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"bufferDropReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncQueue"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12Destinations16BufferDropReportV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"BufferDropReport"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"title":"bufferDropReports","externalID":"s:12Destinations8DeliveryV17bufferDropReports11AsyncQueues0F5QueueVyAA06BufferD6ReportVGvp","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Destinations\/Delivery.swift#L50","fileName":"Delivery.swift"},"role":"symbol"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Delivery\/bufferDropReports","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations":{"role":"collection","title":"Destinations","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Where tracked events go: the "},{"code":"Destination","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol, the modifiers that narrow what a destination receives, and the delivery that hands it batches."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/destinations"},"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations/Delivery":{"title":"Delivery","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Delivery","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The work of delivering a sequence’s batches to destinations, made by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"deliver(to:)"},{"type":"text","text":", and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reports of the batches their full buffers drop."}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Delivery","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/destinations\/delivery","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Delivery"},"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations/Delivery/bufferDropReports":{"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Delivery\/bufferDropReports","url":"\/documentation\/destinations\/delivery\/bufferdropreports","abstract":[{"text":"A report of the batches each destination’s full buffer drops, in the order they are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"dropped.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"bufferDropReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"BufferDropReport","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Destinations16BufferDropReportV"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"type":"topic","title":"bufferDropReports","kind":"symbol"},"doc://AsyncQueues/documentation/AsyncQueues/AsyncQueue":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue","role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/asyncqueues\/asyncqueue","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"AsyncQueue","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Elements in the order they are enqueued, kept until they are read; one reader at a time reads"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them."}]},"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations/BufferDropReport":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/destinations\/bufferdropreport","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"BufferDropReport"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/BufferDropReport","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Batches a destination’s full buffer dropped before the destination received them.","type":"text"}],"title":"BufferDropReport","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"BufferDropReport"}]},"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations/Delivery/work":{"title":"work","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The unit of work that delivers: executing it runs the delivery."}],"fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"work","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DeferredTask","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent12DeferredTaskC"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/destinations\/delivery\/work","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Delivery\/work"}}}